        <mxCell id="KCHz7h-SxDL_h4PmOfOz-13" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;Note : the Chart should be Dumb : all the numbers are calculated in the backend, the chart that models the&amp;nbsp; equation&amp;nbsp; is just consuming data, it does not produce data at all , as a result , many calculations will be performed in the backend; I will do these calculations because I understand the chart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
