        <mxCell id="KCHz7h-SxDL_h4PmOfOz-24" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;Once we Find&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;the equation that implments that Idea, we immiaditly go to the following Step ! , we do not want to forget our understanding about the equation , and we want make progress, WE WANT TO SHOW SOME RESULTS TO THE PROFESSOR IMMIDIATELY , AND WE WANT TO ENSURE THAT THIS METHODOLOGY WORKS BEFORE GOING TO TAKE ANY OTHER EQUATION OR WASTE ANY MORE TIME IN THIS METHODOLOGY !&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
